; SCAFFOLDING - NOT RECOVERED SOURCE. The no-SDK fallback import-library definition for the
; shipped d3dx9_25.dll. The build prefers the exact April 2005 SDK's stock library when present.
;
; ★ THE STATIC IMPORT IS THE FAITHFUL CHOICE, NOT A CONVENIENCE. The shipped RendDX9.dll carries a
; static import descriptor for d3dx9_25.dll with FORTY-NINE entries, so a replacement that resolved
; the same functions through LoadLibrary/GetProcAddress would differ from the original in its
; dependency list - visible to `dumpbin /dependents`, which is a check this rebuild runs.
; d3dx9_25.dll ships in the game directory (2,337,488 bytes) alongside d3dx9_24.dll.
;
; ⚠ THE DECORATION MISMATCH. D3DX9 exports UNDECORATED names ("D3DXCreateEffect") but the functions
; are __stdcall, so a C++ declaration references "_D3DXCreateEffect@36" - nine 4-byte parameters.
; The two cannot be reconciled inside this file, and TWO WRONG ATTEMPTS ARE RECORDED HERE because
; both produced a DLL that BUILT AND LINKED CLEANLY and then failed at load:
;
;   "_D3DXCreateEffect@36 = D3DXCreateEffect"  -> lib.exe adds its OWN leading underscore, giving
;                                                 "__D3DXCreateEffect@36" with two. Link error.
;   "D3DXCreateEffect@36 = D3DXCreateEffect"   -> LINKS, but lib.exe uses the LEFT-HAND name as the
;                                                 IMPORT NAME too, so the image asks d3dx9_25.dll for
;                                                 "D3DXCreateEffect@36", which it does not export.
;                                                 LoadLibrary then fails with 127
;                                                 (ERROR_PROC_NOT_FOUND) - a clean link is NOT
;                                                 evidence the import resolves.
;
; The `= internalname` half is ignored for import libraries; the left-hand name becomes both the
; import name and (underscored) the symbol. So the entry below is the PLAIN export name, and the
; decorated-to-undecorated mapping is done at LINK time by the /alternatename pragma in Effect.cpp.
;
; Verify with `dumpbin /imports:d3dx9_25.dll` on the built image: the name listed there must match
; `dumpbin /exports` on the shipped d3dx9_25.dll exactly. `dumpbin /symbols` shows nothing useful
; for an import library - use /linkermember:1.
;
; Only what is actually called is listed. The other thirty-two of retail's forty-nine stay out
; until something needs them: an import this image does not use would still be bound by the loader
; at startup.

LIBRARY d3dx9_25.dll

EXPORTS
    D3DXCreateEffect
;   Added 2026-09-19 for Ra/EffectManager.cpp's .cfx cache arm (sub_10034F60, 0x1003521E): the
;   cached compiled-effect blob is read into a D3DX buffer before D3DXCreateEffect sees it. It is a
;   real static import of the shipped image - `dumpbin /imports:d3dx9_25.dll` lists D3DXCreateBuffer
;   among its forty-nine - so listing it here narrows the gap rather than widening it.
    D3DXCreateBuffer
;   Added 2026-09-21 for Geom/Terrain.cpp and Geom/SurroundingPatch.cpp: the surrounding ring's
;   FLOAT16_2 vertex format (Terrain byte +0x3A8) packs its texcoords and heights with
;   D3DXFloat32To16Array (0x100DEAB0, 0x1018EFB0). A real static import of the shipped image.
    D3DXFloat32To16Array
    D3DXGetImageInfoFromFileInMemory
    D3DXMatrixInverse
;   Added 2026-09-30 for Geom/Overgrowth/OverGrowthCellRender.cpp: OverGrowthCell::appendGeometry
;   (0x100D1B10) transposes the scaled instance matrix's inverse into a local that nothing reads,
;   as shipped (IAT 0x101DB468). A real static import of the shipped image.
    D3DXMatrixTranspose
    D3DXMatrixOrthoLH
;   Added 2026-09-27 for Geom/XpLightManager.cpp (G3): RendDX9's own Frustum view matrix
;   (0x10079E00) is a D3DXMatrixLookAtLH call (thunk 0x101C4A14), which the directional
;   shadow pass's caster view-projection uses. A real static import of the shipped image.
    D3DXMatrixLookAtLH
    D3DXMatrixMultiply
    D3DXCreateTexture
    D3DXCreateTextureFromFileInMemory
    D3DXLoadSurfaceFromMemory
    D3DXLoadSurfaceFromSurface
    D3DXSaveSurfaceToFileA
    D3DXSaveTextureToFileA
    D3DXCreateSphere
    D3DXCreateCylinder
    D3DXCreateBox
;   Added 2026-09-26 for Geom/NameTagRendererDraw.inl: drawArrows and drawIcons build their
;   rotations with it (the thunk 0x101C4ACE). A real static import of the shipped image.
    D3DXMatrixRotationZ
    D3DXGetShaderVersion
;   Added 2026-09-27 (rc_res) for RendDX9/RendDX9Init.cpp: the display-mode render probe
;   sub_10009FF0 assembles its vs.1.1 / ps.1.1 pair with it (the thunk 0x10073D24 jumps
;   through IAT 0x101DB4C0). A real static import of the shipped image.
    D3DXAssembleShader
;   Added 2026-09-30 (TerrainEditable R0, Code/BF2/Geom/TERRAIN_EDITABLE_WORK_ORDER.md):
;   Geom/Terrain.cpp's optimizeLodIndices (sub_100DC0E0) builds two meshes with these (IAT
;   0x101DB47C / 0x101DB450); QuadPatchEditable's bounds (0x1019E160) and SurroundingPatch-
;   Editable's (0x101A4150) call D3DXComputeBoundingSphere (IAT 0x101DB484) and its checkerboard
;   colormap D3DXFillTexture (0x1019F889, IAT 0x101DB4AC) - package R1. All four are real
;   static imports of the shipped image.
    D3DXCreateMeshFVF
    D3DXCreateMesh
    D3DXComputeBoundingSphere
    D3DXFillTexture
;   Added 2026-10-01 (HM1, editor phase F) for RendMisc/EnvMapSystem/EnvMapManager.cpp:
;   generateEnvMaps (0x101C0410) builds each env map's mip chain with it (IAT 0x101DB4A8). A real
;   static import of the shipped image.
    D3DXFilterTexture
;   Added 2026-10-01 (roads step 3) for Geom/RoadEditable.cpp: buildGeometry (0x1013FC00) bounds the
;   tessellated road with D3DXComputeBoundingBox (IAT 0x101DB488) beside D3DXComputeBoundingSphere,
;   and projectToTerrain (0x1013FED0) renders the footprint through D3DXCreateRenderToSurface (IAT
;   0x101DB48C). Both are real static imports of the shipped image.
    D3DXComputeBoundingBox
    D3DXCreateRenderToSurface
;   Added 2026-10-01 for Code/Build/textureatlasbuilder.cmd's no-SDK fallback: the rebuilt
;   TextureAtlasBuilder.dll (RendDX9/TextureAtlas/TextureAtlasBuilder/) imports five d3dx9_25 names,
;   three of them already above. These two are real static imports of the shipped
;   TextureAtlasBuilder.dll (IAT 0x1001B164 / 0x1001B16C), NOT of RendDX9.dll - RendDX9 does not
;   reference them, so its import table is unchanged by their presence here.
    D3DXCreateTextureFromFileExA
    D3DXGetImageInfoFromFileA
